  "description": "Sporting a soft color cruiser-style steel frame and hi-tensile steel fork, this bike is made to last. The cruiser style tires are perfect for neighborhood streets, and the easy to use coaster brake system lets children stop simply by pedaling backwards. It's equipped with front & rear fenders and an adorable handlebar mounted storage basket. The seat is height adjustable, while the handlebar is angle adjustable, so you can get the perfect fit for your growing child. The included training wheels are removable, letting mom or dad choose when it's time to take the next step. Soft brown faux leather saddle and grips add a nice touch and play nicely with the soft color and cream accents. The 12\" Mila is a great option for the girly-girl in your life!\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
